{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48903","headline":"岳阳云梦亭看莲花 · 崔橹","name":"岳阳云梦亭看莲花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"似醉如慵一水心，斜阳欲暝彩云深。\n清明月照羞无语，凉冷风吹势不禁。\n曾向楚台和雨看，只於吴苑弄船寻。\n当时爲汝题诗徧，此地依前泥苦吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}